<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-yr JGB auction gives lowest price of 99.19.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-yr JGB auction gives lowest price of 99.19.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 500 billion yen in six-year government bonds produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 99.19     Stop rate	   2.454 pct</p>
<p>Average price	99.25     Average yield     2.441 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.2859 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	499.5 billion yen</p>
<p>Bid to cover ratio 2.57 times</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 89.7297 pct</p>
<p>Issue date    Sept 20, 1996   Maturity    Sept 20, 2002</p>
<p>Coupon payment     March 20, Sept 20</p>
</text>
